- $f_{\text{MOUNT AYR}} = 96.58$, $f_{\text{WAUKEE}} = 94.06$, $f_{\text{WAVERLY}} = 94.37$, $f_{\text{PELLA}} = 82.88$, $f_{\text{DES MOINES}} = 94.96$
